window.products.push({"id":233057,"name":"Navy Emporium USCGC Bibb WPG 31 Coast Guard Plaque","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nIRJAGTQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Display your Coast Guard pride for all to see with the personalized USCGC Bibb (WPG-31) plaque. We are offering this premium metal plaque measuring 3 inches in diameter and includes an acrylic stand, high quality quilted gift box, and up to three lines of engraved personalization! Show your pride in the USCGC Bibb and your proud contribution to the protection of our nation!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nIRJAGTQL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Navy Emporium","source_asin":"B07D9F2GH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-233057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D9F2GH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D9F2GH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":233058,"name":"OneWorld Memorials Red, White and Blue Flag Bronze Keepsake Urns - Extra Small - Holds Up to 3 Cubic Inches of Ashes - White Cremation Urn for Ashes -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.17,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GBejJV0yL._AC_.jpg","description":"Nothing represents love of country more than this patriotic keepsake urn. A fitting tribute to the one who served selflessly, the United States flag is prominently displayed, immortalizing duty, honor and love of country. Perfect for family members who wish to share ashes of a loved one, these mini urns are meant to be proudly displayed in the home or office. On special occasions such as Memorial Day or the 4th of July, remember a loved one by placing this Red, White and Blue Flag Keepsake Urnin a place of honor.Brass is a lightweight metal alloy made of 90% copper and 10% zinc. It gives off a bright golden appearance when polished. Oftentimes, brass cremation urns are finished with bronze or pewter to strengthen the brass and to alter the color. The bronze finish has a more reddish hue, whereas the pewter finish gives off a silver hue. Brass is also easy to cast in a mold as it is a malleable material that can be coated in enamel or paint. It is used in multiple capacities for a wide variety of purposes and has a long history as a favored material for everything from cookery to fine art to metal cremation urns. Our brass cremation urns showcase the fine balance this diverse material offers. The beauty and functionality of brass have given it a high standing among metals and alloys, and it is among the most popular choices in our large selection of cremation urns for ashes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31GBejJV0yL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OneWorld Memorials","source_asin":"B074MHSKZT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-233058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074MHSKZT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074MHSKZT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
