window.products.push({"id":233146,"name":"VIAGDO Artificial Eucalyptus Tree 5ft Tall 368 Silver Dollar Leaves Plants Fake Eucalyptus Stems Silk Plants for Living Room Decoration Modern Artific","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n5mFEvljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ABOUT THE HEIGHT=This artificial eucalyptus tree is 5ft from its pot bottom to the tree top when removing out from the shipping box while the leaves are in upright state. Any adjusting ways like bending its trunk and leaves will cause its height look less than 5ft/59in/150cm. Please be aware before you buy. Any problems regarding this artificial plant, please contact us at any time. Artificial Eucalyptus Tree==Standing in a cement plastic pot, this fake eucalyptus tree is 5ft tall from the planter bottom to the tree top. With one main trunk, several stems and 368 silver dollar shaped leaves, this fake eucalyptus plant is truly a delicate replica of a live eucalyptus tree. Artificial tree can not wither or die and free from constant care needed like live plants. Handmade Fake Plants==This fake eucalyptus plant is created with complex bionic technology using silk cloth and polyester, environmental friendly and no odor. Clear textured variegated green leaves and brown bark bring a contrast beauty. Bunches of leaves and branches spread out to different directions, looks full and alive. If it’s for outdoor use, please avoid direct sunlight and rain washing. Adjustable Branches Tree==Wrapped in a plastic bag, shipped in carton, this fake tree may look different as in the pictures. Inserted with soft metal wires, the leaves and branches can be bent to different angles and directions. Please separate and fluff the branches and leaves to achieve the desired fullness. The finer the adjustment, the fuller it looks. Decorative Evergreen Tree==Artificial eucalyptus tree plants are sought-after ornamental due to its silver dollar leaf form. This fake tree is planted in a black nursery pot, centered and stable. A decorative pot large than 5inx6in(HxW) is recommended to match your decor. The shape and color will remain the same over the years. Just wipe it clean with a wet rag when it gets dusty. No other maintenance needed. Wide Application==Native to Australia, this fake evergreen eucalyptus plant add an exotic touch to spaces that need texture and some color. It is a perfect decor for home office, living room, bathroom, bedroom, study room, entry way, dark corners, void spaces, etc. Events like parties, weddings, ceremonies, carnivals can also be decorated with this fake tree.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71n5mFEvljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIAGDO","source_asin":"B09CM557NC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-233146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CM557NC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CM557NC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
