window.products.push({"id":233196,"name":"Doberman Martini by Ryan Fowler, 18x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vGm5ZoJvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a vintage poster of a Doberman balancing a Martini on its nose.Ryan Fowler is an illustrator and graphic artist based in Chicago and Middlebury, Vermont. Ryan received his MFA from Rhode island school of design where he studied photography. His artistic process was informed by his study of photography and photographic printing methods, both in the darkroom and on the computer. Ryan uses a Hybrid of traditional and modern techniques utilizing drawings, paintings, and computer-based illustration tools. Ryan covers a variety of subject matter with his work including animals, landscapes, children's art, typography and graphic design. His work is inspired by nature, advertising design, and new England and Pacific northwest iconography.Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vGm5ZoJvL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B071KCMGK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-233196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071KCMGK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071KCMGK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":233197,"name":"Modtek Curtain and Drapery Ring Glide Tape-Solves Shower and Drapery Rings from catching Allowing Them to Slide SMOOTHLY and Quietly (24 Ft Clear)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JlTm-Wn4L._AC_SL1217_.jpg","description":"As a mother of 4, I forever searched for solutions to fix annoying shower curtain and drapery rings from sticking and catching on curtain rods. I wanted something that would allow rings to glide QUIETLY and SMOOTHLY across the rods without getting stuck at the joint or dragging across the rod loudly. I tried several tapes, pulls, wands and nothing worked quit like I wanted it to. Our tape is extra thick with an adhesive sticky membrane on one side allowing it to stick to most surfaces without damaging. Long lasting even with daily use. It will work on most curtain rods including telescoping and fluted rods. Installation: Easy & quick to install. For best results clean the top of the rod with INCLUDED alcohol whips. Starting at one end of the curtain pole, gradually remove the Red backing tape and adhere the tape along the top the entire length of the rod.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JlTm-Wn4L._AC_SL1217_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modtek","source_asin":"B095JVN9W3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-233197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095JVN9W3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095JVN9W3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
