window.products.push({"id":233324,"name":"American Mug Pottery Butter Keeper/Butter Dish, Made in USA, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J0z4pIpsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The butter keeper is a modern version of the authentic French butter crock. Made from high quality stoneware, the butter keeper safely keeps butter at room temperature on the counter or tabletop without spoilage, refrigeration or odors. Offered by American Mug Pottery this butter keeper is hand made in East Liverpool, Ohio. East Liverpool, Ohio was once known as the pottery capital of the world before companies began to outsource their production to China and other foreign countries. This butter keeper is handcrafted in quality stoneware the old-fashioned way. Each butter keeper is made using the slip-cast method, finished by hand and kiln-fired in a factory that was built in the early 1900s. All butter keepers are dishwasher safe and have been tested and certified to be lead and cadmium free for your families safety. Available in Red, Blue, White, Yellow and Black.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J0z4pIpsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Mug Pottery","source_asin":"B01EYHOZG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-233324","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EYHOZG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EYHOZG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":233325,"name":"Sivio Blanket Sweatshirt, Plush Flannel Sherpa Wearable Blanket with Sleeves and Giant Pocket, Oversized Hoodie for Women and Men, Rainbow Circle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+rneqK4QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sherpa & Flannel, 100% Microfiber Snuggle-cozy Blanket Sweatshirt: Plush flannel and fuzzy Sherpa are liked by all for their fluffy textures and warm touches. Sivio use these two best fabrics on its newest reversible blanket hoodie to wrap you up in the warmest bundle. Our sweatshirt is A-shaped to allow maximum flexibility in wearing while fitting most body shapes. Cute Looks & Practical Uses: Oversized sweatshirt hoodie looks whimsical and chic on all. Giant hood and loose neckline allow you to breath at ease without any stuffy feel. Soft elastic cuffs keep cold air out and pull up easy for when needed. Giant kangaroo pocket stores your phone, remote, snacks while keeping your hands and puppy warm. All Fitting Adults and Kids Size: We designed adults and kids size to fit every member of your family. Adult size is 43 inches long with 111 inches waistline for teenagers above 14 or adults. Kids’ size is 28 inches long with 89 inches waistline for 7 -14 year old children. Get one of these divine sweatshirts for each of your family and have a blast home time in blissful comfort. Sturdy & Superb Gift: Had enough of your old sweatshirts torn apart after just a few wears? Sivio dedicate to making every blanket count, we use edgy sewing technology and premium fabric to make the sweatshirts outlast years of wear and wash. They come in classic solid colors and trendy rainbow colors, making a great addition to holidays and fantastic gift for loved ones so you all can enjoy slumbering together. Care and Warranty: These blanket hoodies are machine washable, tumble dry on low heat, do not iron, dry clean, or bleach. Sivio endeavor to deliver the best products and services, we offer 30 day refund and 12 month warranty. If you have any questions, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+rneqK4QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sivio","source_asin":"B097M9KPCP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-233325","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097M9KPCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097M9KPCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
