window.products.push({"id":233743,"name":"olorvela Candles for Men Mens Candle Birthday Gifts for Men Scented Candles Gifts for Women 8oz, 50hr Burn Time, All Natural Soy Candle (Woods & Leath","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LtPFTVfYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mens Candle with Strong Fragrances - olorvela Candles for Men are poured with all natural soy wax and 8% premium fragrance oils from CPL AROMAS, more strong than most other scented candles. The sensual and calming masculine scent of WOODS & LEATHER, releases a symphony of comforting and relaxing fragrance. Black Candles with Nice Gifting Ready Package - This aromatherapy candle comes in an all-black jar and is beautifully packaged. For the love of your family or friends, suitable for every situation, birthday, Christmas, father's day, anniversaries or just to say \"thank you\". Everyone will be delighted to receive this candle and they will use and enjoy it! Non Toxic Candles Clean Burn for 50hours - This olorvela black jar soy candle made of all natural soy wax and 100% cotton candle wicks, could burn clean and safe in your home for a total of about 50 hours. Great Room Decor for Men - Burning a olorvela scented candle at home is an extremely easy way to diffuse an agreeable fragrance in your room and to feel good. The scent makes your home personal and brings you comfort and confidence. Premium Soy Candle - olorvela scented candles are poured with premium organic soy wax and pre-waxed cotton wicks. Soy wax is 100% biodegradable and the wicks are made of 100% percent cotton, burn smooth and clean, are non-toxic, no lead and zinc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LtPFTVfYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"olorvela","source_asin":"B0B8ZL86B3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-233743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8ZL86B3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8ZL86B3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":233744,"name":"Trademark Fine Art WAP0111-3PC-SET-LG an Evening Out Neutral by Julia Purinton, Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Lr6kEuBbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped multi panel canvas art set features people in a park. Fine artist and muralist Julia Purinton divides her time between the gentle landscape of north shore Boston and a small rural village in Vermont. Both places provide plenty of material for her evocative landscape paintings. She describes her Massachusetts studio as \"dog kennel, potting shed, mud room and sanctuary.\" Working in oils, acrylics, venetian plaster and glaze, Julia's artwork has the luminous glow of images by artists who influence her: Mayfield Parish, Winslow Homer and the Brandywine River School painters. Many layers of glaze create the atmospheric moods of her landscapes. Her work is found in galleries on the east coast. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Lr6kEuBbL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B01NANBICH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-233744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NANBICH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NANBICH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
