window.products.push({"id":233771,"name":"Tenavo Digital Mini Rice Cooker 4 Cups Uncooked, 2L Rice Cooker Small, Portable Rice Cooker Small for 3-4 People, Travel Rice Cooker, Multi-cooker wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617NeMprYcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【8 SMART PROGRAMS】 The Tenavo smart mini rice cooker adheres to the concept of healthy and green life, allowing you to feel a healthy life at your fingertips. You just touch different menus for different cooking experiences. The eight smart programs are quick rice, brown rice, white rice, slow cook, quinoa, steel cut oats, steam, and keep warm. 【PERFECT RICE EVERY TIME】 The Tenavo Grains & Rice Cooker comes with the Smart Temperature Control System, and user-friendly with button control panel & LED indicator light, 24-hour timer. The Smart Temperature Control System that automatically detects and adjust the temperature and ensures rice and grains are at their best texture at all time. 【PORTABLE & COMPACT】This smart mini rice cooker comes with a portable handle and removable power cord, It is convenient for you to mention the rice cooker and not burn your hands, doesn’t take up much space, and is convenient to carry around, suitable for small kitchen, office, dormitory, camping or traveling. 【EASY TO CLEAN AND SAFE】The Tenavo Grains & Rice Cooker all the accessories are made of BPA-free food-grade material. And the inner pot with non-stick coating is not only making the cleaning like a breeze, but also free of PFAS, PFOA, lead, and cadmium for healthy cooking. 【4-CUP CAPACITY】4 cups uncooked capacity yield up to 4-6 bowls of cooked rice and grains, specially designed for small families of 3-5 people, singles or couples, because you only need to cook the right amount of rice, and there are no leftovers. 【MULTI-COOKER】This electric rice cooker could suit different eating preferences, you can cook quick rice, brown rice, white rice, slow cook, quinoa, steel cut oats, steam vegetables. You can also cook noodles, soup, oatmeal, porridge, sushi rice, pasta, risotto, paella, you name it! 【WARRANTY SERVICE】Come with 1-year warranty service. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. Tenavo is sincerely willing to provide you with the best service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617NeMprYcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tenavo","source_asin":"B09DYJ5VBV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-233771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DYJ5VBV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DYJ5VBV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
