window.products.push({"id":233803,"name":"Goodful Double Wall Vacuum Sealed, Insulated Water Bottle with Two Interchangeable Lids, Sipping or Chugging Lids, Leak-Proof, Wide Mouth for Drinking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-vKYtIlnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a water bottle you can take anywhere? Tired of water bottles that sweat? The 40 Oz. Insulated Bottle with Two Interchangeable Lids is the water bottle you are looking for. This double wall vacuum sealed insulated bottle can keep drinks icy cold for up to 24 hours or hot for up to 8 hours. The wide mouth of the bottle allows you to easily add ice cubes for cold drinks so you can enjoy iced drinks for hours. Take your bottle with you while hiking, biking, walking, running, going to the gym or to work- anywhere you go, this bottle can come with you! The screw on lids are leak proof, so you can place this bottle in a gym bag, purse, backpack and more without worrying about your beverage leaking everywhere. One lid features a straw for easy sipping while working out or on the go, while the other screw on lid is a regular cap that allows you to drink your favorite beverage with ease. Use the built-in carry loop to easily tote your bottle with you on the go. Whether you're off to yoga, going on a hike or going to work, this bottle is easy to bring with you everywhere you go. This water bottle is made without BPA and is made with high quality stainless steel so you can enjoy your beverages in a healthy way without flavors transferring from the bottle into your drink. Using this reusable flask also cuts down on the use of single-use plastic water bottles, saving our landfills from unnecessary plastics.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-vKYtIlnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goodful","source_asin":"B0971X9FHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-233803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0971X9FHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0971X9FHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
