window.products.push({"id":233941,"name":"Gevi Toaster 4 Slice,Led Display Touchscreen Bagel Toaster with Dual Control Panels of Bagel/Reheat/Defrost/Cancel/Toasting One Slice/Longer Function,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E6ErUzpcL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"4 EXTRA-WIDE BREAD TOASTING SLOTS:This Best Rated Prime 4 Slice Toasters measures with Four 1.18\" wide slots which can be used to bake different types of bread,such as waffle,or thick artisanal bread.Dual High Lift Lever is designed to bake different sizes of bread and take bread out safely. LED DISPLAYED TOUCH SCREEN:4 Slice Toaster comes with the LED display control panel. The digital displayed toaster built-in LED screen indicating toasting setting, making it easy to see the choice of shade setting.There is a light-bar near the lever that will illuminate, and parts of it will extinguish as the toasting gets closer to completion.Convenient to know the process of toasting. 6 TOAST SHADE SETTINGS:Choosing from lightly golden to deep(1-6) dark toasted slice.It heats the bread evenly and to get the favorable toasting color results for individual preferences, 6 degree and time of baking can be set, choose different degree according to the thickness of bread. The adjustable modes of the toaster are ranged from 1 to 6, if you are not satisfied with the browning level,you can press the longer function icon to add the time of toast or bagel. BASIC FUNCTION OF BAGEL, DEFROST, REHEAT ,CANCEL,THEONE and LONGER: Six screen touch buttons for toast functions ,easily pressing the icons to choose the function you need and control the state of toasts for ideal results. (Bagels: toast one side and keep other side warm; Defrost: Thaw frozen bread out; Reheat: Heat the cold bread; Cancel: Stop toasting at any time; The ONE: Designed to toast both side of only one slice of bread evenly ; Longer: Extend the toasting time by 30s .) DUAL INDEPENDENT CONTROL PANELS:Dual Independent Control Panels It equivalent to 2 toasters, prepare breakfast twice fast than a 2-slice toaster! Easy to Clean with Removable Crumb Tray!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E6ErUzpcL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gevi","source_asin":"B0C68CHP5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-233941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C68CHP5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C68CHP5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
