window.products.push({"id":233966,"name":"Ultrasonic Cool Mist Humidifier-small bedroom humidifier,Baby Humidifier with Adjustable Mist Output, Dial Knob,2 Spray Modes and 7-Color Light,Auto S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N9VZGJc2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"New spray humidifier:Mini portable personal cool mist air humidifier has 2 mist modes. The unique jellyfish-shaped spray can not only humidify the air, but also the jellyfish swimming in the air is within reach, which can be viewed and decompressed. The fast hydration mode can be used as a Face humidifier to effectively moisturize dry skin and help reduce skin peeling. small bedroom humidifier color led:7-colorful soft gradient night light could create a sweet and romantic sleeping atmosphere,improve your sleep quality!Also you could get it work as night light.Comfort zone whisper-quiet cool mist portable humidifier is suitable for home,office,travel,party,etc.It is the best choice for you to give gifts to your family and friends.PS:Do not use essential oils or distilled water,It will block the cotton swab and make the humidifier unusable.Please use tap water. Two mist modes: This mini humidifier has two modes. When pressing the button for the first time (jellyfish spray mode 6H), you need to align the spray port in the direction of the button. When pressing it again (fast hydration mode 4H), the spray port needs to be aligned with the direction of the atomizing sheet. 360ml large capacity produces longer mist. Quiet Ultrasonic Humidifier:This small humidifiers for office operate at low than 32dB almost silent frequency, which will not affect your work and sleep.The mini humidifier for home, office desks and travel. It is a perfect choice for your life, work or as a gift! Kind Reminder:The humidifier needs to be plugged in a USB cable, For the first use, you need to turn on the humidifier after soaking the cotton swab completely. Otherwise, the humidifier will not fog up.. Products and services:1 X USB humidifier,1 X cotton swab,1 X data cable,1 X user manual;1 free replacement cotton swab. If you have any questions about our products,please contact us first,and we will do our best to solve the problem for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61N9VZGJc2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fuliying","source_asin":"B0B5GLRD9Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-233966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5GLRD9Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5GLRD9Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
